<title>SINGAPORE: Bangladesh tenders to buy kerosene for May 23-24.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh tenders to buy kerosene for May 23-24.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Bangladesh Petroleum Corp (BPC) has issued a tender to buy 155,000 barrels of superior kerosene for May 23-34 delivery on a cost-and-freight (c-and-f) basis to Chittagong, traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>The tender closes on May 6 and offers would be valid until May 13.</p>
<p>BPC bought 155,000 barrels of jet fuel from Swiss trader Glencore at $1.48 per barrel above Singapore spot quotes for April 22-24 delivery, on a c-and-f Chittagong basis.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65-870 3084)</p>
